Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"NaiveMovingAverage"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on pool2 to see if narrowing to the more stable models improves over the weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the small, most stable pool1 to see if a smaller set improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy on a correlated but strong model, ONLY_FT_rf, to see if a single strong model beats weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the most stable 5‑model pool (pool1) to see if a more robust, low‑variance combination beats the current weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on pool2 to see if a different pooling set improves over weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over the pool3 set to see if trimming the less stable models improves over the weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test the best single ETS model to see if a single strong model beats the weighted baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy on a strong model that hasn’t been tried yet, e.g., ONLY_DWT_catboost, to see if a single model can beat the weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_DWT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weighting on the more stable pool3 to see if a simple weighted scheme improves over baseline weighted w1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the more stable pool3 to see if it improves over the weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

